"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸浆 10-20240815164055-kg99ilu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 448px;\" parent-style=\"width: 458px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 734px;","style":"width: 724px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸浆 (16)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸浆 16-20240815165235-jc3wip7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 724px;\" parent-style=\"width: 734px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815164822-q1yucut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815164822-q1yucut","updated":"20240815165135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸浆 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸浆 14-20240815164822-uaigt7e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 535px;","style":"width: 525px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸浆 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸浆 15-20240815165135-zr0m3ok.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 525px;\" parent-style=\"width: 535px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240815163815-zrymkmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240815163815-zrymkmz","updated":"20240815163826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：品种较多，以上取图为杂图；"}]},{"ID":"20240611161657-qofz7jd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161657-qofz7jd"}},{"ID":"20240611161658-u5zxz9y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161658-u5zxz9y","updated":"20240611161703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161658-ee6vvdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161658-ee6vvdu","updated":"20240611161658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即灯笼草。性味苦寒，清肺止咳。佛耳草，治寒痰咳嗽，此治热痰咳嗽，力能解利湿亦治黄病。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161628-gazvh6n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161628-gazvh6n"}},{"ID":"20240611161648-tdkcmy2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161648-tdkcmy2","updated":"20240611161652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161648-vhg5lyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161648-vhg5lyj","updated":"20240611161648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天下皆有之。苗如天茄子，开小白花，结青壳。熟则深红，壳中子大如樱，亦红色。樱中复有细子，如落苏之子，食之有青草气。此即苦耽也。今《图经》又立苦耽条，显然重复。《本经》无苦耽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161628-3gdr0by","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161628-3gdr0by"}},{"ID":"20240611161634-5irrfes","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161634-5irrfes","updated":"20240611161639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161634-dkrq1lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161634-dkrq1lc","updated":"20240611161634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，平、寒，无毒。主治热烦满，定志，益气，利水道，产难吞其实，立产，一名醋浆。生荆楚川泽及人家田园中。五月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161634-ngn1iji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161634-ngn1iji","updated":"20240611161634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处处人家多有，叶亦可食。子作房，房中有子如梅李大，皆黄赤色。小儿食之，能除热，亦治黄病，多效。（《大观》卷八，《政和》二一一页）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161554-or6534l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161554-or6534l"}},{"ID":"20240611161622-n0edx04","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161622-n0edx04","updated":"20240611161626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161622-azlyd9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161622-azlyd9a","updated":"20240611161622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名灯笼草，俗名挂金灯"}]},{"ID":"20240611161622-0pj8kkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161622-0pj8kkq","updated":"20240611161622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161622-pd7twx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161622-pd7twx5","updated":"20240611161622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主热烦满，定志，益气，利水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161622-g3uftf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161622-g3uftf5","updated":"20240611161622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆利湿除热清肺，治咳化痰，痰热去而志定气和矣。又主咽喉肿痛。盖此草治热痰咳嗽，佛耳草治寒痰咳嗽。故其主治各有专司也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161554-lz3klsa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161554-lz3klsa"}},{"ID":"20240611161608-x5lesai","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161608-x5lesai","updated":"20240611161616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161608-xk9e33s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161608-xk9e33s","updated":"20240611161611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"酸浆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生荆楚川泽及人家田园中，今处处有之。苗似水茄而小，叶亦可食；实作房如囊，囊中有子如梅李大，皆赤黄色，小儿食之尤有益，可除热；根似菹芹，色白，绝苦，捣其汁饮之，治黄病多效。五月采，阴干。《尔雅》所谓 （音针），寒浆。郭璞注云∶今酸浆草，江东人呼为苦 是也。今医方稀用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161554-kmtuull","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161554-kmtuull"}},{"ID":"20240611161555-9zoioq7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-9zoioq7","updated":"20240611161602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-0l3z3dj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-0l3z3dj","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所在有之。一名灯笼草。与龙葵（俗呼天茄子）一类二种。但龙葵茎光无毛。夏秋开小白花。五出。黄蕊。结子无壳而有蒂。盖数颗同枝。生青熟紫黑。其酸浆同时开黄白小花。紫心白蕊。花如杯状。无瓣而有五尖。结一铃壳。凡五棱。一枝一颗。下悬如灯笼状。壳中一子如龙葵子。生青熟赤。以此分别。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-ea6b80u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-ea6b80u","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苗叶茎根"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-tk3i0g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-tk3i0g3","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。气寒。除热利湿。主治烦满痰壅。热咳咽痛。腹内热结。大小便涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-ubgl2g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-ubgl2g9","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治黄病。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-panrupd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-panrupd","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-2ym4lmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-2ym4lmu","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸平。气寒。主治热烦。利水道。疗黄病。并痰癖热结。与苗茎同功。尤以其轻能治上焦。故主热咳咽痛。此草治热痰咳嗽。佛耳草治寒痰咳嗽。与片芩清金丸同用更效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161555-9g7ezvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161555-9g7ezvl","updated":"20240611161555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（止。溺赤涩痛者。酸浆草嫩叶一握。净洗。捣绞汁一合。和酒一合。烧热。空心服之。立通。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161335-23g2j78","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161335-23g2j78"}},{"ID":"20240611161435-nl6587h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161435-nl6587h","updated":"20240611161444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161435-5q94l4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161435-5q94l4p","updated":"20240611161435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即灯笼草．通、清湿热．"}]},{"ID":"20240611161435-a5smnfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161435-a5smnfp","updated":"20240611161435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒．除热利湿．清肺化痰．除烦满．通小便．（治黄病效．）治上气咳嗽．（并煮汁、或研膏、生捣汁服．）敷小儿闪癖．（丹溪曰∶灯笼草、苦能除湿热、轻能治上焦、故主热嗽咽痛、此草治热痰咳嗽、佛耳草、治寒痰咳嗽也、时珍曰∶酸浆除热、故能清肺、治咳、利湿、故能化痰治癖、一人病虚乏、有痰咳嗽、以此加入汤中、甚效．）根茎花叶．俱可用．（叶贴灸疮、不发．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161435-6ykcerw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161435-6ykcerw","updated":"20240611161435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子、酸平．与根茎花叶同功．（天泡湿疮、捣子敷之、或为末、油调．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161335-m4fb7ph","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161335-m4fb7ph"}},{"ID":"20240611161417-1wgkxb9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-1wgkxb9","updated":"20240611161427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161417-3ty1jaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-3ty1jaa","updated":"20240611161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，平、寒，无毒。主热烦满，定志益气，利水道，产难吞其实立产。一名醋浆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161417-pbsir46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-pbsir46","updated":"20240611161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生荆楚川泽及人家田园中。五月采，阴干。陶隐居云∶处处人家多有。叶亦可食，子作房，房中有子，如梅李大，皆黄赤色。小儿食之能除热，亦主黄病，多效。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本云∶根如菹芹，白色，绝苦。捣其汁治黄病，多效。尔雅云∶ ，寒浆。注∶今酸浆草，江东人呼曰苦 。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161417-jhyrl0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-jhyrl0f","updated":"20240611161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶酸浆，生荆楚川泽及人家田园中，今处处有之。苗似水茄而小，叶亦可食。实作房如囊，囊中有子，如梅李大，皆赤黄色。小儿食之尤有益。可除热。根似菹芹，色白，绝苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161417-tidvou9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-tidvou9","updated":"20240611161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捣其汁饮之治黄病，多效。五月采，阴干。《尔雅》所谓 （音针），寒浆。郭璞注云∶今酸浆草，江东人呼为苦 是也。今医方稀用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161417-s2fhi8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-s2fhi8q","updated":"20240611161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"千金方∶治妇人赤白带下。三叶酸草阴干为末。空心酒下三钱匕。灵苑方∶治卒患诸淋，遗沥不止，小便赤涩疼痛。三叶酸浆草，人家园林亭槛中，着地开黄花，味酸者是。取嫩者净洗，研绞自然汁一合，酒一合，搅汤暖，令空心服之，立通。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161417-xztljzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161417-xztljzx","updated":"20240611161417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶酸浆，今天下皆有之。苗如天茄子，开小白花，结青壳。熟则深红，壳中子大如樱，亦红色。樱中腹有细子，如落苏之子，食之有青草气。此即苦耽也。今《图经》又立苦耽条，显然重复。《本经》无苦耽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161335-6bpgnph","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161335-6bpgnph"}},{"ID":"20240611161402-gpcwzc4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-gpcwzc4","updated":"20240611161408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161402-cdd5q63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-cdd5q63","updated":"20240611161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」醋浆、革针、苦耽、灯笼草、虎弁草、天泡草、王母珠、洛神珠。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161402-tnwaurk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-tnwaurk","updated":"20240611161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（苗、叶、茎、根）苦、寒、无毒。（子）酸、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161402-i3dq5gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-i3dq5gt","updated":"20240611161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611161402-t6knp9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-t6knp9r","updated":"20240611161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、热咳咽痛。用酸浆草为末，开水送服。此方名“清心丸”。同时还以醋调药末敷喉外。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161402-qu3fkb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-qu3fkb0","updated":"20240611161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、痔疮。用酸浆叶贴疮上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161402-99psoxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161402-99psoxy","updated":"20240611161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、肠胃伏热。用酸浆果实五两、苋实三两，马蔺子（炒）、大盐榆白皮（炒）各二两、柴胡、共同芩、栝楼根、闾茹各一两，共研为末，加炼蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，木香汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161743-uicjvn3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161743-uicjvn3"}},{"ID":"20240611161745-vlieth6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-vlieth6","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酢浆草"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-msms30l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-msms30l","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：酢浆草"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-hm3buwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-hm3buwy","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-oub09wo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-oub09wo","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸浆草、酸酸草、斑鸠酸、三叶酸"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-p427vog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-p427vog","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-cxpqlz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-cxpqlz3","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酢浆草科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酢浆草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Oxalis corniculata L.的全草。四季可采，以夏秋有花果时采药效较好，除去泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-94w692i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-94w692i","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-4zjjjlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-4zjjjlh","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-u9izlga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-u9izlga","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-m1t5ib8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-m1t5ib8","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿，解毒消肿。用于感冒发热，肠炎，尿路感染，尿路结石，神经衰弱；外用治跌打损伤，毒蛇咬伤，痈肿疮疖，脚癣，湿疹，烧烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-9br56f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-9br56f3","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-irvgau5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-irvgau5","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 0.5～2两；外用适量，鲜品捣烂敷患处，或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-hw7wlbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-hw7wlbg","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-asxsr6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-asxsr6r","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-ijuk91m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-ijuk91m","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：酢浆草"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-gug11fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-gug11fn","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-pwhw50v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-pwhw50v","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zuò Jiānɡ Cǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-i2vvui7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-i2vvui7","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-1wm49iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-1wm49iq","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸箕（李当之《药录》），三叶酸草（《千金方》），醋母草、鸠酸草、小酸茅（《唐本草》），雀林草（《外台秘要方》），酸浆、赤孙施（《本草图经》），醋啾啾、田字草（《百一选方》），酸浆草（《履巉岩本草》），雀儿草、酸母草（《永类钤方》），酸饺草（《滇南本草》），小酸苗（《品汇精要》），酸草（《摘元方》），三叶酸、三角酸、雀儿酸（《纲目》），酸迷迷草（《纲目拾遗》），斑鸠草、酸味草（《生草药性备要》），三叶酸浆（《植物名实图考》），酸酸草（《分类草药性》），酸斑苋（《岭南采药录》），咸酸草、酸酢草（《福"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-s9sh015","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-s9sh015","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-e4afotb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-e4afotb","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《唐本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-596c3ty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-596c3ty","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-k619958","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-k619958","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为酢浆草科植物酢浆草的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-z8awvmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-z8awvmh","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-kuf4eib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-kuf4eib","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于耕地、荒地或路旁。全国各地均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-fiqkuh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-fiqkuh7","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-c7w4nrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-c7w4nrr","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本。茎匍匐或斜升，多分枝，长达50厘米，上被疏长毛，节节生根。叶互生，掌状复叶，叶柄长2.5～5厘米；托叶与叶柄连生，形小；小叶3枚，倒心脏形，长达5～10毫米，无柄。花1至数朵成腋生的伞形花序，花序柄与叶柄等长；苞片线形；萼片5，花瓣5，黄色，倒卵形；雄蕊10，花丝下部联合成筒；子房心皮5，5室，花柱5，离生，柱头头状。蒴果近圆柱形，长1～1.5厘米，有5棱，被柔毛，熟时裂开将种子弹出。种子小，扁卵形，褐色。花期5～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-a9fo2pl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-a9fo2pl","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-baxdx3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-baxdx3a","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 茎叶含多量草酸盐。另有谓叶含柠檬酸及大量酒石酸，茎含苹果酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-r2z9anr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-r2z9anr","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-u8bbhbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-u8bbhbk","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对金黄色葡萄球菌有抗菌作用，对大肠杆菌则无效；此植物据云对羊有毒。同属植物毛茛酢浆草能伤害家畜肾脏，使血中非蛋白氮明显升高。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-bk2azx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-bk2azx5","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-k0kf7w0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-k0kf7w0","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《得配本草》：\"入手阳明、太阳经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-n6bujvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-n6bujvl","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-5zvjmms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-5zvjmms","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-tz7srx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-tz7srx3","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《唐本草》：\"味酸，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-lbtjgns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-lbtjgns","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《履巉岩本草》：\"味酸，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-mkf9bpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-mkf9bpr","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草》：\"性寒，味酸微涩。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-l8a94tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-l8a94tw","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-kzn5x8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-kzn5x8r","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿，凉血散瘀，消肿解毒。治泄泻，痢疾，黄疸，淋病，赤白带下，麻疹，吐血，衄血，咽喉肿痛，疔疮，痈肿，疥癣，痔疾，脱肛，跌打损伤，汤火伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-n56wqn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-n56wqn7","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《唐本草》：\"主恶疮瘸瘘捣敷之，杀诸小虫。\"\"食之解热渴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-2r0a971","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-2r0a971","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草图经》：\"治妇人血结不通，净洗细研，暖酒调服之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-pvopc1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-pvopc1h","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《滇南本草》：\"治久泻肠滑，久痢赤白，用砂糖同煎服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-f6kokcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-f6kokcj","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"主小便诸淋，赤白带下，同地钱、地龙治砂石淋；煎汤洗痔痛脱肛；捣敷汤火蛇蝎伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-9e2959r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-9e2959r","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《生草药性备要》：\"杀螆止痛，散热消肿，理跌打，散瘀血，煲酒服；又干水止痒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-qqcxw2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-qqcxw2d","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医林纂要》：\"补肺泻肝，除热气，去瘀血，敛阴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-buw7pb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-buw7pb9","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《分类草药性》：\"截疟塞鼻；酒炒敷鱼口。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-uc53kv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-uc53kv3","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《岭南采药录》：\"治麻疹，蛇毒，疥疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-u1ieoxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-u1ieoxl","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《陆川本草》：\"消肿止痛，去腐肉。治疮痈溃烂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-gvii5rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-gvii5rq","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《贵阳民间药草》：\"清热，利尿，接骨。治尿结，黄疸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-k9gk0hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-k9gk0hu","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾《中国药植图鉴》：\"用红糖混煎服，治流火（丝虫病初期）。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-qju2jtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-qju2jtr","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿《陕西植药调查》：\"健胃止咳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-ci8zmo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-ci8zmo9","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀《湖南药物志》：\"治发热咳嗽，心胃气痛，疮疡肿胀作痛，毒疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-uxehmth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-uxehmth","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-rqhdjv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-rqhdjv5","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～4钱（鲜者1～2两）；捣汁或研末。外用：煎水洗、捣敷、捣汁涂、调敷或煎水漱口。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-tft2wo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-tft2wo6","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-6ltlcgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-6ltlcgl","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治水泻：酸浆草三钱冲，加红糖蒸服。（《云南中医验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-sjt5573","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-sjt5573","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治痢疾：酢浆草研末，每服五钱，开水送服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-yyzedmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-yyzedmd","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治湿热黄疸：酢浆草一两至一两五钱。水煎二次，分服。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-9tkbz3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-9tkbz3a","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治血琳热淋：酸浆草取汁，入蜜同服。（《履巉岩本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-mt3hk0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-mt3hk0v","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治尿结尿淋：酸浆草二两，甜酒二两。共同煎水服，日服三次。（《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-oxl66q5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-oxl66q5","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治二便不通：酸草一大把，车前草一握。捣汁入砂糖一钱，调服一盏；不通再服。（《摘元方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-znf7i16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-znf7i16","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小便不通，气满闷：酸浆草一握。研取自然汁，与醇酒相半，和服；不饮酒，用甘草三寸，生姜一枣大，锉，同研，用井华水五分盏，滤取汁和服亦得。（《圣济总录》酸浆酒）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-70pp2zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-70pp2zn","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治赤白带下：三叶酸草，阴干为末，空心温酒服三钱匕。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-q1e9t4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-q1e9t4k","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治麻疹：酸味草每用二钱至三钱。水煎服。（《岭南采药录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-hy6tw0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-hy6tw0u","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治鼻衄：鲜酢浆草杵烂，揉作小丸，塞鼻腔内。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-nlax7ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-nlax7ru","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治吐衄：酢浆草四钱，食盐数粒。水煎服。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-yqgsy0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-yqgsy0u","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治疟疾：酢浆草三钱，水煎服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-buo12x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-buo12x2","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治齿龈腐烂：鲜酢浆草和食盐少许，捣烂绞汁，用消毒棉花蘸汁，擦洗患处，一日三、五次。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-mph5luw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-mph5luw","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治咽喉肿痛：鲜酢浆草一至二两，食盐少许。共捣烂，用纱布包好含于口中；或煎汤漱口。并治口腔炎。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-kbfs4au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-kbfs4au","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治喘咳：鲜酢浆草一两，加米少许煮服，连服三剂。（《浙江民间常用草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-1h071pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-1h071pu","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治疔疮：鲜酢浆草，和红糖少许，捣烂为泥，敷患处。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-5fo400u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-5fo400u","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治乳痈：酢浆草五钱。水煎服，渣抖烂外敷。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-90rfq4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-90rfq4p","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治腹部痈肿：鲜酢浆草二两。放碗内捣出汁，热甜酒冲，去渣服。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-zlfehvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-zlfehvb","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治癣疮作痒：雀儿草擦之，数次即愈。（《永类钤方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-7ru3wmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-7ru3wmg","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治痔：雀林草一大握，粗切。以水二大升，煮取一升，顿服尽，三日重作一剂。（《外台秘要方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-k6e7416","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-k6e7416","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治跌打新老损伤：㈠酢浆草根三钱，甜酒煎服。㈡鲜酢浆草四份，葱头二份，生姜一份，酒酿糟五份。同杵烂，炒热，布包熨之，俟温敷伤处。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-zfft2qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-zfft2qx","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）治创伤青肿：鲜酢浆草二两。搓伤处；又用鲜草二两，加红糖五钱。开水炖服。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-e2vlrsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-e2vlrsh","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（23）治汤火伤：鲜酢浆草洗净捣烂，调麻油敷患处。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-07jn5si","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-07jn5si","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（24）小便血淋。用酢浆草捣汁，煎五苓散服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-bw9gevm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-bw9gevm","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（25）牙齿肿痛。用酢浆草一把，洗净，加川椒（去核）四十九粒，同捣烂，捏成豆大小粒。每以一粒塞痛处，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-thyc36p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-thyc36p","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-lxqkgc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-lxqkgc8","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗失眠"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-4ub9i28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-4ub9i28","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取酸浆草10斤、松针2斤，加水8000毫升，煎1小时，过滤去渣；另取大枣1斤捣碎，加水2000毫升煎1小时，过滤去渣。将两液混合，加适量糖及防腐剂备用。每服15～20毫升，每日3次。观察5000余例，有一定的镇静、安眠效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-0shi5il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-0shi5il","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗传染性肝炎"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-o6qtxnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-o6qtxnr","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取酢浆草1两，瘦猪肉1两炖服。每日1剂，连服1周。治疗20余例（部分病例配合中药复方治疗），均取得一定疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-9z48thv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-9z48thv","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-2l12094","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-2l12094","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-8us8xfj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-8us8xfj","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：酢浆草"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-da17ovf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-da17ovf","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-sp94e81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-sp94e81","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zuò Jiānɡ Cǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-4gudsrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-4gudsrw","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-adq6gtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-adq6gtr","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸箕、三叶酸草、酸母草、鸠酸草、小酸茅、雀林草、酸浆、赤孙施、酸啾啾、田字草、酸浆草、雀儿草、酸母草、酸饺草、小酸苗、酸草、三叶酸、三角酸、雀儿酸、斑鸠草、酸味草、酸迷迷草、三叶酸浆、酸酸草、酸斑苋、咸酸草、酸酢草、酸得溜、铺地莲、酸梅草、三叶破铜钱、黄花梅、满天星、黄花草、六叶莲、野王瓜草、王瓜酸、冲天泡、长血草、酸芝草、酸批子、东阳火草、水晶花、蒲瓜酸、鹁鸪酸、斑鸠酸、三梅草、老鸦酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-d3h68pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-d3h68pv","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-io2u486","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-io2u486","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Creeping Woodsorrel Herb, Herb of Creeping Oxalis"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-fa4rstt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-fa4rstt","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-be16j6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-be16j6k","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热利湿；凉血散瘀；解毒消肿"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-vtb0nuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-vtb0nuv","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-bzlcurw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-bzlcurw","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为酢浆草科植物酢浆草的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-0wujq0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-0wujq0e","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Oxalis corniculata L.[O.repens Thunb.]"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-swij3ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-swij3ee","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：生于荒地、田野、道旁。全年均可采收，尤以夏、秋季为宜，洗净，鲜用或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-jduev8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-jduev8r","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-u8hawe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-u8hawe9","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分布于全国大部分地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-y4p0edc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-y4p0edc","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-ik7hasg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-ik7hasg","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酢浆草 多年生草本。根茎细长，茎细弱，常褐色，匍匐或斜生，多分枝，被柔毛。总叶柄长2-6.5cm；托叶明显；小叶3片，倒心形，长4-10mm，先端凹，基部宽楔形，上面无毛，叶背疏生千伏毛，脉上毛较密，边缘具贴伏缘毛；无柄。花单生或数朵组成腋生伞形花序；花梗与叶柄等长；花黄色，萼片长卵状披针形，长约4mm，先端钝；花瓣倒卵形，长约9mm，先端圆，基部微合生；雄蕊的花丝基部合生成简；花枝5。葫果近圆柱形，长1-1.5cm，略具5棱，有喙，熟时弹裂；种子深褐色，近卵形而扁，有纵槽纹。花期5-8月，果期6-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-zg96oqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-zg96oqu","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-wdnza4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-wdnza4o","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜温暖湿润气候，喜阴湿地生长。以疏松肥沃、富含腐殖质的砂质壤上或壤上栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-cf2kjth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-cf2kjth","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子繁殖。4月播种，撒播或条播，播后薄覆细土，以不见种子为度，稍加镇压。经常浇水保持土壤湿润。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-isqo958","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-isqo958","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 生长期间经常拔除杂草，追施稀人粪尿或硫酸铵、尿素等。遇雨水过多要及时排除积水；遇旱要适时埔溉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-bae33zt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-bae33zt","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-142j8ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-142j8ff","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 为段片状。茎、枝被疏长毛。叶纸质，皱缩或破碎，棕绿色。花黄色，萼片、花瓣均5枚。蒴果近圆柱形，有5条棱，被柔毛，种子小，扁卵形，褐色。具酸气。味咸而酸涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-batt25j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-batt25j","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-pbb3o72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-pbb3o72","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含抗坏血酸（ascorbic acid），去氢抗坏血酸（dehydroascorbic acid），丙酮酸（pyruvic acid），乙醛酸（glyoxalicacid），脱氧核糖核酸（deoxyribonucleic acid），牡荆素（vitexin），异牡荆素（isovitexin），牡荆素-2”-O-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙（vitexin-2〃-O-β-D-glucopyranoside），以及17种化合物：如2-庚烯醛（2-heptenal），2-戊基呋喃（2-pentylfuran），反式植醇（trans-phytol），并含中性类脂化合物（neutral lipid），糖脂（glycolipide），磷脂（phospholipide）以及脂肪酸（C10-C14），a-生育酚（a-tocopherol），β-生育酚（β-tocopherol）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-mg9veva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-mg9veva","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-tl2zo3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-tl2zo3w","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对金黄色葡萄球菌有抗菌作用，对大肠杆菌则无效；此植物据云对羊有毒。同属植物毛茛酢浆草Oxalis cernus 能伤害家畜肾脏，使血中非蛋白氮明显升高。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-891hkiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-891hkiy","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-5vvnzqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-5vvnzqw","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大肠；小肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-wkjniu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-wkjniu7","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-989r0io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-989r0io","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸；寒"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-12mi5oj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-12mi5oj","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-bioyeie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-bioyeie","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治水泻： 酢浆草三钱冲，加红糖蒸服。(《云南中医验方》)②治痢疾： 酢浆草研末，每服五钱，开水送服。(《湖南药物志》)③治湿热黄疸：酢浆草一两至一两五钱。水煎二次，分服。 (《江西民间草药》)④治血淋热淋： 酸浆草取汁，入蜜同服。(《履CHAN岩本草》)⑤治尿结尿淋： 酸浆草二两，甜酒二两。共同煎水服，日服三次。 (《贵阳民间药草》)⑥治二便不通： 酸草一大把， 车前草一握。捣汁人砂糖一钱，调服一盏；不通再服。 (《摘元方》)⑦治小便不通，气满闷： 酸浆草一握。研取自然汁，与醇酒相半，和服；不饮酒，用甘草三寸，生姜一枣大，锉，同研，用井华水五分盏，滤取汁和服亦得。 《圣济总录》酸浆酒)⑧治赤白带下： 三叶酸草， 阴干为末，空心温酒服三钱匕。(《千金方》)⑨治麻疹： 酸味草每用二钱至三钱。水煎服。(《岭南采药录》)⑩治鼻衄： 鲜酢浆草杵烂，揉作小丸，塞鼻腔内。(《江西民间草药》)(11)治吐衄： 酢浆草四钱，食盐数粒。水煎服。 (《闽东本草》)(12)治疟疾： 酢浆草三钱，水煎服。 (《湖南药物志》)(13)治齿龈腐烂： 鲜酢浆草和食盐少许，捣烂绞汁，用消毒棉花蘸汁，擦洗患处，一日三、五次。 《江西民间草药》)(14)治咽喉肿痛： 鲜酢浆草一至二两，食盐少许。共捣烂，用纱布包好含于口中；或煎汤漱口。并治口腔炎。(《闽东本草》)(15)治喘咳： 鲜酢浆草一两， 加米少许煮服，连服三剂。(《浙江民间常用草药》)(16)治疗疮： 鲜酢浆草，和红糖少许，捣烂为泥，敷患处。(《江西民间草药》)(17)治乳痈： 酢浆草五钱。水煎服，渣抖烂外敷。 (《湖药物志》)(18)治腹部痈肿： 鲜酢浆草二两。放碗内捣出汁，热甜酒冲，去渣服。 (《江西民间草药》)(19)治癣疮作痒： 雀儿草擦之。 (《永类钤方》)(20)治痔： 雀林草一大握，粗切。 以水二大升，煮取一升，顿服尽，三日重作一剂。 (《外台秘要方》)(21)治跌打新老损伤： 一、酢浆草根三钱。甜酒煎服。二、酢浆草四份，葱头二份，生姜一，酒酿糟五。同杵烂，炒热，布包尉之，俟温敷伤处。 (《江西民间草药》)(22)治创伤青肿： 鲜酢浆草二两。搓伤处；又用鲜草二两，加红糖五钱。开水炖服。 (《闽东本草》)(23)治汤火伤： 酢浆草洗净捣烂，调麻油敷患处。 (《闽东本草》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-nnjdfve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-nnjdfve","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-1stdceq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-1stdceq","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗失眠：取酢浆草10斤、松针(云南松 Pinus yunnanensis Franch．)加水8000ml，煎1小时，过滤去渣；另取大枣1斤捣碎，加水2000ml煎 1小时，过滤去渣。将两液混合，加适量糖及防腐剂备用。每服15-20ml，每日3次。观察5000余例，有定的镇静、安眠效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-014b3ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-014b3ub","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗传染性肝炎：取酢浆草 1两，瘦猪肉1两炖服。每日 1剂，连服 1周。治疗20余例(部分病例配合中药复方治疗)，均取得一定疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-958ouyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-958ouyq","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-pze8g70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-pze8g70","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，9-15g，鲜品30-60g；或研末；或鲜品绞汁饮。外用：适量，煎水洗、捣烂敷、捣汁涂或煎水漱口。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-ghp1h2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-ghp1h2f","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-kh8mvn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-kh8mvn0","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 湿热泄泻；痢疾；黄疸；淋证；带下；吐血；衄血；尿血；有经不调；跌打损伤；咽喉肿痛；痈肿疔疮；丹毒；湿疹；疥癣；痔疮；麻疹；烫火伤；蛇虫咬伤"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-3bglfrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-3bglfrg","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161745-nkbcmee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161745-nkbcmee","updated":"20240611161745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161335-hkur7vf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161335-hkur7vf"}},{"ID":"20240611161336-p6byr5s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-p6byr5s","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：酸浆"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ey7o89u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ey7o89u","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-p4e7vt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-p4e7vt8","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Suān Jiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-l7u7g8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-l7u7g8c","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-kymuq9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-kymuq9o","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 葴、寒浆（《尔雅》），醋浆（《本经》），苦葴、苦蘵、皮弁草（崔豹《古今注》），酸浆草（《尔雅》郭璞注），灯笼草（《唐本草》），苦耽（《嘉佑本草》），金灯草（《履巉岩本草》），姑娘菜、灯笼儿（《救荒本草》），红姑娘（《卮言》），天泡草（《纲目》），红娘子（《柳边纪略》），珊瑚架（《汪连仕采药书》），山瑚柳、天灯笼草（《纲目拾遗》），九古牛（《植物名实图考》），泡子草，扑扑子草（《福建民间草药》），花姑娘（《民间常用草药汇编》），姑娘花（《四川武隆药植图志》），打朴草（《闽南民间草药》），叶下灯、铃"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-qgm26fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-qgm26fl","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-e431rpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-e431rpp","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-jwgso4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-jwgso4x","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-idz2hzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-idz2hzk","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为茄科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酸浆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏季采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-u0x2eag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-u0x2eag","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-hopz0w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-hopz0w1","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生长于路旁及田野草丛中；也有栽培作观赏植物者。全国大部分地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-6ir8myx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-6ir8myx","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-iuhl2pb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-iuhl2pb","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高35～100厘米。具横走的根状茎。茎直立，多单生，不分枝，略扭曲，表面具棱角，光滑无毛。叶互生，通常2叶生于一节上；叶柄长8～30毫米；叶片卵形至广卵形，长4～10.5厘米，宽2～6.5厘米，先端急尖或渐尖，基部楔形或广楔形，边缘具稀疏不规则的缺刻，或呈波状，上面光滑无毛，下面几无毛。花单生于叶腋，花梗长1～1.5厘米；花白色，直径1.5～2厘米；花萼绿色，钟形，长约1厘米，先端5裂，边缘及外侧被短毛；花冠钟形，5裂，裂片广卵形，先端急尖。边缘具腺毛；雄蕊5，着生在花冠的基部，花药长圆形，基部着生，花丝丝状；子房上位，卵形，2室，花柱线形，柱头细小，不明显。浆果圆球形，直径约1.2厘米；光滑无毛，成熟时呈橙红色：宿存花萼在结果时增大，厚膜质膨胀如灯笼，长可达4.5厘米，具5棱角，橙红色或深红色，无毛，疏松地包围在浆果外面。种子多数，细小。花期7～10月。果期8～11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-0fxeq5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-0fxeq5r","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根（酸浆裉）、宿萼或带有成熟果实的宿萼（挂金灯）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-w48kw7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-w48kw7x","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-u9bn804","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-u9bn804","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含酸浆苦素A。酸浆苦素B，酸浆苦素C、木犀草素及木犀革素-7-β-D-葡萄糖甙。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-18lz59s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-18lz59s","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-h67rhwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-h67rhwn","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①抗菌作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-hzbw1nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-hzbw1nn","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸浆煎剂对宋内氏杆菌有抑制作用，酸浆抗菌有效成分初步认为在油状液，此部分在试管内对绿脓杆菌、金黄色葡萄球菌有抑制作用，从酸浆中提出之针状晶母液对金黄色葡萄球菌有抑制作用。酸浆体外抑菌效果与临床治痢疗效不符。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-fsxd68v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-fsxd68v","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②兴奋子宫的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-nkafwr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-nkafwr9","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早年提出的对离体家兔子宫有兴奋作用的酸浆根素（即硝酸钾）。其果实据云有催产作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-4st3aq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-4st3aq5","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③其他作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-9h2qdov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-9h2qdov","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日本酸浆果实及果囊有解热及强心作用，有谓酸浆之此项作用与其中所含草酸有关，且作用微弱，无应用价值。酸浆根素注射于动物，表现大脑抑制，若用大量，可使呼吸麻痹而死。国外曾用其同属植物的叶、果作利尿剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-iizcwkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-iizcwkt","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-z17rjei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-z17rjei","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《得配本草》：\"入手太阴经气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ex72r0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ex72r0q","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《闽东本草》：\"入肺、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-hnw1ri2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-hnw1ri2","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-unc9l39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-unc9l39","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-xa84bno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-xa84bno","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味酸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-rgl2ccz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-rgl2ccz","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-pvawbug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-pvawbug","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"味苦：大寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-096ow2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-096ow2b","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-7zhzmmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-7zhzmmo","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《现代实用中药》：\"有堕胎之弊。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-3s8nxae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-3s8nxae","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《闽东本草》：\"凡脾虚泄泻及痰湿忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ecwdycn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ecwdycn","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-0b6k859","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-0b6k859","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，解毒，利尿。治热咳，咽痛，黄疸，痢疾，水肿，疔疮，丹毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-1cvkguc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-1cvkguc","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主热烦满，定志益气，利水道。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-xymv609","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-xymv609","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《唐本草》：\"主上气咳嗽，风热，明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-97ynbbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-97ynbbu","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《嘉祜本草》：\"主腹内热结眉黄，不下食，大小便涩，骨热咳嗽，多睡劳乏，呕逆痰壅，痃癖痞满，小儿疬子寒热，大腹，杀虫，落胎，并煮汁服，亦生捣绞汁服。亦研敷小儿闪癖。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-pp3yo8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-pp3yo8a","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草衍义补遗》：\"治热痰嗽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-pxe7b89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-pxe7b89","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《汪连仕采药书》：\"清火，消郁结，治疝。敷一切疮肿，专治锁缠喉风。治金疮肿毒，止血崩，煎酒服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-h90zy8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-h90zy8p","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《民间常用草药汇编》：\"清热解毒。治白喉初起，鹅口疮，失音（煅灰作散剂吞服）。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-t8c08aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-t8c08aw","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-dksl0ia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-dksl0ia","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～5钱；捣汁或研末。外用：煎水洗、研末调敷或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-6i4n3z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-6i4n3z2","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-k6szy0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-k6szy0n","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治热咳咽痛：灯笼草，为末，白汤服，仍以醋调敷喉外。（《丹溪纂要》清心丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-v3m4fri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-v3m4fri","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治喉疮并痛者：灯笼草，炒焦为末，酒调，敷喉中。（《医学正传》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-4e0ywo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-4e0ywo4","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治黄疸，利小便：酸浆、茅草根、五谷根各五钱。煎水服。（《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-iqjp1lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-iqjp1lk","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿小便不通：酸浆草五钱。煎水服。（《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-6kyhh5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-6kyhh5e","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治诸般疮肿：金灯草不以多少，晒干，为细末，冷水凋少许，软贴患处。（《履巉岩本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-w8hd9cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-w8hd9cc","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治杨梅疮：打朴草，不拘数量，水煎数沸，候微温洗患处。（《闽南民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-wfszob7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-wfszob7","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治中耳炎：锦灯笼鲜草拧汁，加冰片适量，滴耳。（《陕西中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-y7olu1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-y7olu1v","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-zmlrd3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-zmlrd3q","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗小儿上呼吸道炎症：用100％的锦灯笼注射液肌肉注射，每日2次，5岁以下每次2毫升，5岁以上每次4毫升。临床观察120例，全部患儿均有不同程度发热，80％以上病例有咽痛症状及不同程度的扁桃体肿大，且有脓性渗出物。治疗结果，显效（于两天内体温降至正常，临床症状与咽部脓性渗出物消失）93例（77.5％），有效（于3～5天内体温降至正常，临床症状与咽部脓性渗出物消失）20例（16.7％），无效（体温与咽部脓性渗出物5天以内均未好转，症状无明显变化）7例（5.8％）。单项统计，80％以上的患者体温可以在2天内降至正常，90％以上的病例扁桃体分泌物及咽痛症状在3天内消失。但扁桃体肿大仅8例于治疗4天后略见缩小，其余均无明显改变。此外，有报道用锦灯笼花萼2～3个或全草3～5钱，1次煎服或冲茶服，治疗急性扁桃体炎32例，结果除2例用药2次外，均1次痊愈。治愈时间最短半天，最长3天。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-0f6uta3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-0f6uta3","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-a3mezt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-a3mezt6","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①朱震亨：\"灯笼草，苦能除湿热，轻能治上焦，故主热咳咽痛，此草治热痰咳嗽，佛耳草治寒痰咳嗽也。与片芩清金丸同用更效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-jhwxn4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-jhwxn4x","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"酸浆，利湿除热，除热则清肺止咳，利湿故能化痰、治疸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-kjedugx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-kjedugx","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目拾遗》：\"天灯笼草，主治虽伙，惟咽喉是其专治，用之功最捷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ztkkjt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ztkkjt7","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-151q25h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-151q25h","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-rofqpmw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-rofqpmw","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：酸浆"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-vmngmki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-vmngmki","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-kne2zqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-kne2zqp","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Suān Jiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-zhbnp5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-zhbnp5w","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-8r7tnfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-8r7tnfz","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蒧、寒浆、醋浆、苦蒧、皮弁草、酸浆草、酢浆、灯笼草、苦耽、金灯草、姑娘菜、灯笼儿、挂金灯、红姑娘、天泡草、苦精、红娘子、珊瑚架、山瑚柳、天灯笼草、九古牛、打朴草、金灯笼、锦灯笼、蓝花天仙子、野木瓜、野胡椒椒"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-wpzrryv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-wpzrryv","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-rxep52d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-rxep52d","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Calyx or fruit of Franchet Groundcherry, Franchet Groumdcherry Calyx and Fruit"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-4uzohre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-4uzohre","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-s150dau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-s150dau","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》；1.《别录》：酸浆，生荆、楚川泽及人家田园中。五月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-njdfix2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-njdfix2","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：酸浆，处处人家多有。叶亦可食。子作房，房中有子，如梅李大，皆黄赤色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-x936t0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-x936t0x","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：灯笼草，所在有之。八月采。枝干高三、四尺，有花，红色，状若灯笼，内有子，红色可爱。根、茎、花、叶并入药用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-c5rcvev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-c5rcvev","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《梦溪笔谈》：苦耽，即本草酸浆也。河西番界中酸浆有盈丈者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-iemr74f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-iemr74f","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草衍义》：酸浆，"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-xevqea1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-xevqea1","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-0acxqdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-0acxqdn","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为茄科植物酸浆有挂金灯的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-u47iu0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-u47iu0r","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Physalis alkekengi L.2.Physalis alkekengi L.var .francheti (Mast.) Makino [P.francheti Mast.;P. francheti Mast. Var .bungardii Makino]"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-2be3up2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-2be3up2","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季采收，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-nejb5l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-nejb5l6","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-qj16u37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-qj16u37","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于空旷地或山坡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ce9lmi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ce9lmi4","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于村旁、路边、旷野、山坡及林缘等处；亦有栽培。除西藏外，全国各地无有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-8esk6sf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-8esk6sf","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于陕西、甘肃、河南、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州和云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-wzbighg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-wzbighg","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-caxv0ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-caxv0ni","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，基部常匍匐生根。茎高约40-80cm，基部略带木质。叶互生，常2枚生于一节；叶柄长约1-3cm；叶片长卵形至阔形，长5-15cm，宽2-8cm，先端渐尖，基部不对移狭楔形，下延至叶柄，全缘而波状或有粗芽齿，两面具柔毛，沿叶脉亦有短硬毛。花单生于叶腋，花梗长6-16mm，开花时直立，后来向下弯曲，密生柔毛而果时也不脱落；花萼阔钟状，密生柔毛，5裂，萼齿三角形，花后萼筒膨大，弯为橙红或深红色，呈灯笼状包被将果；花冠辐状，白色，5裂，裂片开展，阔而短，先端骤然狭包被浆果；花冠辐状，白色，5裂，裂片开展，阔而短，先端骤然狭窄成三角形尖头，外有短柔毛；雄蕊5，花药淡黄绿色；子房上位，卵球形，2室。浆果球状，橙红色，直径10-15mm，柔软多汁。种子肾形，淡黄色。花期5-9月，果期6-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-pstrz16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-pstrz16","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形态与原种相似，主要区别为：花梗几无毛或仅有稀疏毛，花萼除裂片毛较密外筒部稀疏；果成熟后果梗及果萼光滑无毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-bpd9ai9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-bpd9ai9","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-8w9nenp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-8w9nenp","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜温暖、潮湿气候，但能耐寒，在北方稍冷的地方也可生长。以肥沃、排水良好的砂质壤土或粘壤土栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-qr9ulkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-qr9ulkg","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子或分根繁殖。种子繁殖：北京地区在4月初播种，苗床宽1m，用条播法，播后覆土1cm，浇水，并保持适当的湿润；苗高3cm时间苗，高14cm时定植，行距35-50cm，株沟，沟距33-40cm，将根横放在沟内，上面盖土4-6cm，并将土耙匀，镇压后浇水。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-kv11j6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-kv11j6o","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 干旱时及时浇水，特别在开花期，要经常保持充足的水分。苗高13-16cm时，应追施人粪尿1次，或每1hm2追施硫酸铵275kg，过磷酸钙300kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-jywgilo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-jywgilo","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-h53w74p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-h53w74p","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 茎圆柱形，木质化较硬。叶互生，完整的叶片阔卵形，长5-15cm，宽2-8cm，先端尖，基部不对称，波状缘有粗齿。宿萼卵形，直径1.5-2.5cm，先端尖，基部不对称，波状缘有粗齿。宿萼卵形球形，直径1.5-2.5cm，黄绿色，薄纸质。浆果球形，皱缩，直径1-1.2cm，。气微，味苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-htey7lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-htey7lb","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-qrklph2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-qrklph2","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸浆根素注射于动物，表现大脑抑制，若用大量，可使呼吸麻痹而死"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ruicp7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ruicp7k","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-a6np9kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-a6np9kp","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸浆叶中含木犀草素-7-β-D-葡萄糖甙（lute-olin-7-β-D-glucoside)[1]。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-x2g8nip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-x2g8nip","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全草含酸浆环氧内酯（physalactone)[2]，全草及根均含酸浆双古豆碱（phygrine)[3]。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-oqknyo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-oqknyo3","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-7bjt14b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-7bjt14b","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.杭菌作用：酸浆煎剂对宋内氏杆菌有抑制作用，酸浆抗菌有效成分初步认为在油状液，此部分在试管内对绿脓杆菌、金黄色葡萄球菌有抑制作用，从酸浆中提出之针状晶母液对金黄色葡萄球菌有抑制作用。酸浆体外抑菌效果与临床治痢疗效不符。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ezqmq6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ezqmq6g","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.兴奋子宫的作用：早年提出的对离体家兔子宫有兴奋作用的酸浆根素(Hystonin，即硝酸钾)。其果实据云有催产作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-j3ufqeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-j3ufqeh","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.其他作用：日本酸浆果实及果囊有解热及强心作用，有谓酸浆之此项作用与其中所含草酸有关，且作用微弱，无应用价值。酸浆根素注射于动物，表现大脑抑制，若用大量，可使呼吸麻痹而死。国外曾用其同属植物的叶、果作利尿剂。果实鲜汁用平板打尚洞法，对金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌等有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-yg866s2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-yg866s2","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-yrjc4md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-yrjc4md","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肺；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-iy0f2qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-iy0f2qp","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ha9uzdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ha9uzdv","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味酸；苦；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-0hj853v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-0hj853v","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-an6u4l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-an6u4l1","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《现代实用中药》：有堕胎之弊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-szm2znw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-szm2znw","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《闽东本草》：凡脾虚泄泻及痰湿忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-rdvnilo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-rdvnilo","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-87rydks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-87rydks","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热毒；利咽喉通利二便。主咽喉肿痛；肺热咳嗽；黄疸；痢疾；水肿；小便淋涩；大便不通；黄水疮；湿疹；丹毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-7stwdw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-7stwdw9","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-qq61f8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-qq61f8m","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，9-15g；或捣汁，研末。外用：适量，煎水洗；研末调敷或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-27umv3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-27umv3m","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-gwwbf9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-gwwbf9j","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治热咳咽痛： 灯笼草，为末，白汤服，仍以醋调敷喉外。 (《丹溪纂要》清心丸)②治喉疮并痛者： 灯笼草，炒焦为末，酒调，敷喉中。(《医学正传》)③治黄疸，利小便： 酸浆、茅草根、五谷根各五钱。煎水服。 (《贵阳民间药草》)④治小儿小便不通： 酸浆草五钱。煎水服。(《贵阳民间药草》)⑤治诸般疮肿： 金灯草不以多少，晒干，为细末，冷水凋少许，软贴患处。(《履CHAN岩本草》)⑥治杨梅疮： 打朴草，不拘数量，水煎数沸，候微温洗患处。(《闽南民间草药》)⑦治中耳炎： 锦灯笼鲜草拧汁，加冰片适量，滴耳。 (《陕西中草药》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-umtgvhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-umtgvhv","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-22ulyy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-22ulyy1","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗小儿上呼吸道炎症：用100%的锦灯笼注射液肌肉注射，每日2次，5岁以下每次2ml，５岁以上每次4ml。临床观察120例，全部患儿均有中同程度发热，80%以上病例有咽痛症状及不同程度的扁桃体肿大，且有脓性渗出物。治疗结果，显效(于两天内体温降至正常，临床症状与咽部脓性渗出物消失)93例(77.5%)，有效(于3-5天内体温降至正常，临床症状与咽部脓性渗出物消失)20例(16.7%)，无效(体温与咽部脓性渗出物5天以内均未好转，症状无明显变化)7例(5.8%)。单项统计，80%以上的患者体温可以在2天内降至正常，90%以上的病例扁桃体分泌物及咽痛症状在3天内消失。但扁桃体肿大仅8例于治疗4天后略见缩小，其余均无明显改变。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-0lgxo78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-0lgxo78","updated":"20240611161343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗急性扁桃体炎：此外，有报道用锦灯笼花萼2-3个或全草3-5钱，1次煎服或冲茶服，治疗急性扁桃体炎32例，结果除2例用药2次外，均1次痊愈。治愈时间最短半天，最长３天。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-ymlua0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-ymlua0s","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-r6i71an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-r6i71an","updated":"20240611161345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.灯笼草，苦能除湿热，轻能治上焦，故主热咳咽痛，此草治热痰咳嗽，佛耳草治寒痰咳嗽也。与片芩清金丸同用更效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-99vd3vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-99vd3vu","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：酸浆，利湿除热，除热则清肺止咳，利湿放能化痰、治疸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-w44x11d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-w44x11d","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目拾遗》：天灯笼草，主治虽伙，惟咽喉是其专治，用之功最捷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-vtzylmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-vtzylmj","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经》：主热烦满，定志益气，利水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-yumxdtk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-yumxdtk","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《唐本草》：主上气咳嗽，风热，明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-127neso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-127neso","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《嘉佑本草》：主腹内热结，目黄，不下食，大小便涩，骨热咳嗽，多睡劳乏，呕逆痰壅，痃癖痞满，小儿疬子寒热，大腹，杀虫，落胎，并煮汁服，亦生捣绞汁服。亦研敷小儿闪癖。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-xfzudmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-xfzudmy","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草衍义补遗》：治热痰嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-1hmutnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-1hmutnn","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《汪连仕采药书》：清火，消郁结，治疝。敷一切疮肿，专治锁缠喉风。治金疮肿毒，止血崩，煎酒服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-e5rwm0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-e5rwm0w","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《民间常用草药汇编》：清热解毒。治白喉初起，鹅口疮，失音(煅灰作散剂吞服)。"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-tjvfjmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-tjvfjmr","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611161336-4bdvh8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161336-4bdvh8n","updated":"20240611161336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611161337-vui409i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611161337-vui409i"}},{"ID":"20240611161339-u1kj04u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611161339-u1kj04u"}}]}